[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-providus-bank-sme-program-cohort-6-opportunity-for-nigerians-206":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},206,"providus-bank-sme-program-cohort-6-opportunity-for-nigerians-206","Providus Bank Sme Program (cohort 6): Opportunity For Nigerians","\u003Cp>Providus Bank in partnership with Enterprise Development Centre at Pan Atlantic University, has created the Providus Bank SME Program to build the capacity of business owners in Nigeria. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Providus SME program, its Cohort 6, aims to provide young entrepreneurs with the skills and competencies for the development of long-term strategic plans to transform their businesses and drive profitability.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Providus Bank SME Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Providus Bank\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category:  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Ftrainings\u002F\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Business Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Marketing Strategy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Benefits of Providus Bank SME Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Develop a comprehensive growth plan for your business.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Enhance leadership capacity to effectively manage teams.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Define and articulate the value proposition of your business.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Implement sustainable structures for long-term success.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create a go-to-market strategy for your products and services.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Receive personalized business advisory to address specific challenges.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Network with fellow entrepreneurs to share ideas and best practices.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Establish valuable contacts for business and personal development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Benefits of Providus Bank SME Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Develop a comprehensive growth plan for your business.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Enhance leadership capacity to effectively manage teams.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Define and articulate the value proposition of your business.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Implement sustainable structures for long-term success.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create a go-to-market strategy for your products and services.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Receive personalized business advisory to address specific challenges.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Network with fellow entrepreneurs to share ideas and best practices.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Establish valuable contacts for business and personal development.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Providus Bank SME Program (Cohort 6)\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the ProvidusBank SME Program, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Eligibility Check:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure you meet the eligibility criteria outlined above.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Registration:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the “Apply now” button to start your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Complete Application:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Log in to your account and complete the application form.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Save your progress using the “Save And Continue” button and return to it later.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit only one application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Stay Informed:\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Regularly check the PROVIDUSBANK SME Program ‘News and Update’ tab for announcements.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Freg.smetoolkit.africa\u002Fprovidussmecohort6\">https:\u002F\u002Freg.smetoolkit.africa\u002Fprovidussmecohort6\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-04 12:46:46",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fprovidus-bank-sme-program-cohort-6-opportunity-for-nigerians\u002F69f887261ea821.39803625_screenshot 2026-05-04 122044.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fprovidus-bank-sme-program-cohort-6-opportunity-for-nigerians\u002F69f887261ea821.39803625_screenshot%202026-05-04%20122044.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,